{"page":20149,"part":1,"text":"情性\n\n\n艺之至，未始不与精神通，其说见于昌黎《送高闲序》。孙过庭云：“一时而书，有乖有合，合则流媚，乖则彫疏。神怡务闲，一合也；感惠徇知，二合也；时和气润，三合也；纸墨相发，四合也；偶然欲书，五合也。心遽体留，一乖也；意违势屈，二乖也；风燥日炎，三乖也；纸墨不称，四乖也；情怠手阑，五乖也。乖合之际，优劣互差。”\n","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20149,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"7325b5d0e1d79296ae3a7cc189cdc16bb904b238a3a188e46b621d5254810ae7","textSha256":"7325b5d0e1d79296ae3a7cc189cdc16bb904b238a3a188e46b621d5254810ae7","fileSha256":"7325b5d0e1d79296ae3a7cc189cdc16bb904b238a3a188e46b621d5254810ae7","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20149-work-119.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"续书谱 · 情性","sourceUrl":"","originalPages":[406],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"d7a8569799d7f429a57b4589f0d39871c4121ea39d60f95b99f39a8b270b372c","id":"local-406-18-27","page_id":406,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":18,"rawEnd":27,"reviewedTextSha256":"de8f7b4443cd936ce79d15d2a9bd1f043dd8a899dc452ee32f95fe5c9fe0a1c4","displayUnitOrigins":[[24,25],[25,26],[26,27]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":406,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T14:18:39.683Z","revision":"de8f7b4443cd936ce79d15d2a9bd1f043dd8a899dc452ee32f95fe5c9fe0a1c4","textSha256":"de8f7b4443cd936ce79d15d2a9bd1f043dd8a899dc452ee32f95fe5c9fe0a1c4","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":5,"end":158,"sourceTextSha256":"d299ecaffe8bf56428dfb7b1f6f060bb39c921535b3c76dd719f9455fae44ccc","id":"local-406-